## Raster sidecar
Every record carries `raster` + top-level `gate_snn` + `gate_compute`. Windows {wins[0]:.0f}/{wins[1]:.0f}/{wins[2]:.0f} ms; `window_s == window_ms/1000` exactly; `spikes == round(neurons·rate·window_s)` with zero slack ({n_sp[0]}/{n_sp[1]}/{n_sp[2]} at {rates[0]}/{rates[1]}/{rates[2]} Hz over {n_neu[0]}/{n_neu[1]}/{n_neu[2]} neurons); `energy_pJ = spikes·23` and `energy_uJ = spikes·23e-6` exact ({n_sp[0]*23}/{n_sp[1]*23}/{n_sp[2]*23} pJ). Routing source/target + 3-entry tables + `third_factor` on all three (modulators {tfs[0]} / {tfs[1]} / {tfs[2]}; τe {taus[0]}/{taus[1]}/{taus[2]} s as consistent `tau_e_s`+`tau_e_ms` pairs). Excerpts integer `t_us`, in-window, `neuron_id`-bounded, sorted, full-window by construction, per-spike amplitude with adaptation (0.82**k) plus noise. ISI histograms from the full window, bins ≥1 ms, counts sum to `spikes − distinct_active_neurons` ({isis[0]}/{isis[1]}/{isis[2]}). Same-neuron gaps ≥1100 µs pre-round, ≥1000 µs serialized. `gate_snn` on all three: decisions REJECT/MODIFY/ACCEPT matching each lead trajectory; every rate-declaring population's budget exact against its decision window. `gate_compute.per_check` windows 32–40 ms, budgets exact ({gc[0]} / {gc[1]} / {gc[2]}). Main streams: {events[0]}/{events[1]}/{events[2]} events (inside the 5–40 cap), strictly increasing `t_rel_ms` only (no `t_ms` mix), same-channel refractory ≥0.8 ms (139 para pair at 1.3 ms, 140 TOFD pair at 1.2 ms, 141 TEOM pair at 1.5 ms).

## Self-critique

### Edge cases added vs still thin
- **Added:** first magnetodynamic paramagnetic-O2 family on a flare knockout with a recomputable x=k_m·I·(T/T0)·(P0/P) (`5.00 volpct`) plus susceptibility identity and three-party collusion including the Magdyn infra owner; first ultrasonic-TOFD remaining-ligament family on a hydrocracker weld with recomputable d=t_nom−c·Δt/2 (`10.00 mm`) and speed/fd identities, plus a resolved-innocent scanner (timezone-skipped wedge-delay, not last-to-badge); first TEOM baghouse-PM family on a kiln stack with recomputable C=k_t·Δf/Q (`24.00 mg/m3`) plus mdot and df/f0 identities; first bounded ACCEPT whose out-of-scope clause is adjacent baghouse compartments rather than a hopper/taphole/dump cap; operational t2 on all three (N2-purge hold, new-wedge restart, skip-pulse refusal); provenance trio designed/hil/simulated; 18 min / 24 min / 12 min slow floors in-stream.
- **Still thin:** (i) 139's k_m is a lumped mA→volpct gain, not a T/P-dependent susceptibility table — a thermal hop that fakes 5.00 volpct inside a 0.40 volpct Oxyveil corridor is unwritten; (ii) 140's c is a lumped skip-distance speed, not a wedge-delay / mode-converted map, so a skip hop that fakes 10.00 mm is unwritten; (iii) 141's k_t is a lumped flow-split factor, not a filter-loading / Q-bias table, so a flow hop that fakes 24.00 mg/m3 inside a 4.80 last-good is unwritten; (iv) vendor-only as a *lead* REJECT on a plant with *no* independent dumbbell/TOFD/TEOM installed yet remains slightly harder — 139/140 still have plant heads; (v) stream amplitudes remain authored constants (raster draws are the only seeded noise); (vi) r38 densification leftovers (OCT group-index table, DCPD current-spread map, moisture-corrected impact-echo) were left for that round's owner.

### Realism of noise / temporal fidelity
- Strong: 139's 5.00 volpct, chi 1.00, and 18.0 min N2-purge (`6000+1080=7080 s`) recompute from the record; 140's 10.00 mm, c 5.00, and 24.0 min cooldown (`2820+1440=4260 s`) recompute; 141's 24.00 mg/m3, mdot 48.00, and 12.0 min survey (`6000+720=6720 s`) recompute. Raster adaptation (0.82**k plus 4% noise) and the 1.2–1.5 ms physics pairs give the 5–40 stream a raster-scale motif without violating 0.8 ms same-channel refractory.
- **Gaps, honestly:** (i) 5–40 cap still forces heavy thinning (10 Hz dumbbell kept as 4 I points; 5 MHz TOFD A-scan kept as 4 dt points; 1 Hz TEOM frequency kept as 4 df points); (ii) 139's post-stop 3.20 volpct is a later sample, not a closed-loop N2 controller; (iii) 140 HIL coupon times an in-service weld isolate that the stream does not independently witness on a second live weld until the new wedge starts; (iv) no gate_snn input→output volley pair at raster resolution this round (r04-a1 already staged that).

### Training value (SNN/LSM + agentic)
Distillation targets: paramagnetic x=k_m·I·(T/T0)·(P0/P) reconstruction head plus chi identity; conjunctive inert floor vs continue-hot-work vs flare ESD; Magdyn-infra collusion; TOFD d=t_nom−c·Δt/2 head plus speed identity; isolate-floor weld vs keep-whole vs spool-cut; exoneration against last-to-badge social pressure; TEOM C=k_t·Δf/Q and mdot identities; bounded ACCEPT with compartment-out-of-scope; skip-pulse refusal under survey takt. Agentic value concentrates in three patterns: reconstruction-as-SoT on a physical O2/ligament/PM load the raw corridor cannot see, earned ACCEPT with an explicit physical out-of-scope object (C-1..C-3), and stop-then-hold so a REJECT does not become a flare/spool/kiln kill.

